From a256d1fcdb5ce148b30e0460e147670d1969ad56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:06:08 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add aggressive training dummy and generalize combat attacks
 for NPCs

- CombatService: extract BeginAttack shared by players and NPCs; add
  PerformNPCAttack; cooldowns keyed by Player or NPC Model; NPC strength taken
  from the attack, player strength still read from the profile; NPCs only hit
  players (IsPvPAllowed with a nil attacker); feedback only for player attackers.
- TrainingDummyConfig/Service: Aggressive mode (detect nearest player, turn in
  Idle, attack after ReactionTime when in reach and facing) via PerformNPCAttack.
- NPCCombatAnimationService: play the Attack animation on a new attack.
- DebugService/Testui: "Spawn aggressive dummy" action and button.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DLMaP4V7LcPHCrxoi4fJm8
